-- cmd: repl
-- frame-budget: 1
-- stdin: fn deep(n: Int) -> Int { match n { 0 -> 0\n _ -> 1 + deep(n - 1) } }\ndeep(100000)\ndeep(10000)\ndeep(10000)\n:quit\n
-- stderr-contains: error[runtime]: stack overflow: call frames take more than 1 MiB; this task holds 1 MiB
-- An entry whose recursion runs out of the frame budget gives back what
-- its frames took as it ends: the next entries recurse 10,000 levels
-- deep, more than the frames of a VM take outside the budget.
